#{{AIHEADER}}:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="Tests/**, {{ProjectName}}Tests/**"

TEST_COMMAND:
- swift test (SPM)
- xcodebuild test -scheme {{ProjectName}} -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 15'

TEST_CONVENTIONS:
- XCTest for unit and integration tests
- Test class: {{ModuleName}}Tests: XCTestCase
- Test methods: test_<scenario>_<expected> or testThatItDoesX
- UI tests in separate {{ProjectName}}UITests target

COVERAGE_REQUIREMENTS:
- (fill in — e.g., "no hard threshold; focus on model/business logic layers")

FORBIDDEN_IN_TESTS:
- No real network calls — use URLProtocol mocking or dependency injection
- No real Keychain writes in unit tests
- No XCTFail without a descriptive message
